{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Tapioca Pudding is as sweet as her name! Her striking green eyes and soft meows greet you when you come home and follow you from room to room. She is a professional baker who loves making biscuits, and when she's off the clock, she enjoys napping, chasing toys, and eating! Churus and other treats are the way to her heart. Tapioca is looking for her forever home, and hopes that she can find a kind and patient adopter who can give her space when she needs it, and pets and attention when she asks for it.\n\nMy foster writes: Tapioca Pudding, is a shy, calm, loving and a chatty cat. Loves to give head butts, purrs and making biscuits. She takes some time to warm up, but once comfortable showers so much love that fills your whole heart. She responds to Tapi, Tipi, Tap Tap, Tipi Tipi Tap Tap","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=9&searchType=4&animalid=204893","id":"06dadc9c97b5d912e228fc116ecb6981","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/83be68a5927645a1956fd3a51dddab2d-1785941310-1793473083-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/95383c734e024dc5bf2eed9645d94939-1785941407-1785941407-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/7be4c51fb417468a9979688aa0b6fc6e-1785941406-1785941406-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/2f6aaebb187749b79840e3343e52ab75-1785941406-1785941406-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/32ac7998a4ce47cc9d0a781dc2abb88a-1785941406-1785941406-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/bda8e84f46174297be33d13027bda3ac-1785941406-1785941406-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterb